eOptions>) -> SensorUnsubscribe + Send + Sync,>, pub subscribe_quaternion: Arc<dyn Fn(QuaternionListener, Option<SensorSubscribeOptions>) -> SensorUnsubscribe + Send + Sync,>, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct SensorReading { pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub interval: f32, pub timestamp: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct SensorSubscribeOptions { pub frequency: Option<f32>, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Default, PartialEq, Eq)] pub enum SensorAccuracy { High, Low, Medium, #[default] Unknown, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)] pub enum SensorsPermissionSensor { Magnetometer, Motion, Orientation, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)] pub enum SensorsPermissionState { Denied, Granted, Prompt, Unsupported, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct AmbientLightReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub illuminance: f32, pub interval: f32, pub timestamp: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct MotionReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub interval: f32, pub timestamp: f32, pub x: f32, pub y: f32, pub z: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct OrientationReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub absolute: bool, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub alpha: f32, pub beta: f32, pub gamma: f32, pub heading: f32, pub interval: f32, pub timestamp: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct PressureReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub altitude: f32, pub interval: f32, pub pressure: f32, pub timestamp: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct ProximityReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub distance: f32, pub interval: f32, pub max: f32, pub near: bool, pub timestamp: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct QuaternionReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub interval: f32, pub timestamp: f32, pub w: f32, pub x: f32, pub y: f32, pub z: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Debug, Default, PartialEq)] pub struct RotationRateReading { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub accuracy: SensorAccuracy, pub alpha: f32, pub beta: f32, pub gamma: f32, pub interval: f32, pub timestamp: f32, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Clone, Default)] pub struct HostSensorsCapabilities { pub query: Option<HostSensorsCapability>, }
src/types.rs: #[derive(Default)] pub struct Sensors { runtime: EntityRuntimeSlot, pub on_absolute_orientation: Signal<OrientationReading>, pub on_accelerometer: Signal<MotionReading>, pub on_ambient_light: Signal<AmbientLightReading>, pub on_barometer: Signal<PressureReading>, pub on_gravity: Signal<MotionReading>, pub on_gyroscope: Signal<RotationRateReading>, pub on_linear_acceleration: Signal<MotionReading>, pub on_magnetometer: Signal<MotionReading>, pub on_orientation: Signal<OrientationReading>, pub on_proximity: Signal<ProximityReading>, pub on_quaternion: Signal<QuaternionReading>, }
